    "short_description": "",
    "description": "Discover a unique opportunity to own a piece of paradise in Sitio Civoleg, Barangay Lunotan, Gingoog City, Misamis Oriental - along main road.\r\nProperty Details:\r\nAddress: Barangay Lunotan, Civoleg, Gingoog City\r\nLot Number:\r\nLot 1: 11,998 sqm (4548-A)\r\nLot 2: 47,575 sqm (4530)\r\nTotal Land Area: 5.9 hectares\r\nFrontage: 45 meters\r\nTitle status: Clean\r\nTerrain: Sloping but partly flattened as seen in video/photo\r\nPayment terms: Cash\r\nSellling Price: 3500/sqm \r\nProperty Bonus:\r\nStunning elevation: 3,931 ft above sea level\r\nExpansive area: 5.96 hectares\r\nTwo water sources are available\r\nReady electricity line\r\nBeautiful view of Mount Balatukan\r\nCool climate all year round\r\nPrime location along Route 955 (Gingoog–Claveria–Villanueva Road)\r\nNearby Attractions:\r\nIluminada Garden Resort\r\nFlight 387 Shrine\r\nAccessibility:\r\n41-minute drive from Gingoog Highway (23.1KM)\r\n1 hour 5 minutes drive from Villanueva Highway (47.4KM)",
